OL,3,AWhat the Budget offers for under 25s -
OL,4,Aand what it leaves out
OL,5,
OL,6,FChancellor John Healey has announced
OL,7,Fhis Budget, which includes changes to
OL,8,Fminimum wage and help for people trying
OL,9,Fto get onto the housing ladder.
OL,11,FHere is how the Budget could affect you
OL,12,Fif you are under-25.
OL,14,FIf you are an 18-to-20 year-old earning
OL,15,Fthe minimum wage, your pay will go up
OL,16,Fby 3.9% from next April.
OL,23,APub: 28-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
