OL,3,AWhat the Budget offers for under 25s -
OL,4,Aand what it leaves out
OL,5,
OL,6,FHowever, the increase may be lower than
OL,7,Fyou had expected. That is because
OL,8,FHealey reversed course on how his
OL,9,FLabour predecessor, Rachel Reeves, had
OL,10,Fbeen increasing the minimum wage for
OL,11,Fyoung people.
